{"kind": "mod", "id": 2576, "name": "All In Weapon: Unslotted", "slug": "all-in-weapon-unslotted", "teaser": "\"Unslot\" your weapons. Slot your mistakes. No filters. No rules. Only cursed weapons", "owner_name": "Szonszczyk", "downloads": 5845, "favourites": 12, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": null, "guid": "com.szonszczyk.allinweaponunslotted", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Scripting", "category_id": 3, "updated_at": "2026-08-09T10:33:04.000000Z", "created_at": "2026-02-06T21:18:56.000000Z", "published_at": "2026-02-06T21:27:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.1.2", "latest_version": "1.1.2", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": null, "description_html": "<p>Reimagining of the <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/354/all-in-weapon\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>“All In Weapon” mod by Lua</strong></a></p>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Use any mod in any weapon or mod slot</li>\n<li>Use any ammo in any weapon or magazine</li>\n<li>Use any magazine with any weapon</li>\n<li>Remove Conflicting Items - mods no longer exclude each other from being attached to the same weapon</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Screenshots</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ovfd2TF.png\" alt=\"Ovfd2TF.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Z7YVUR0.png\" alt=\"Z7YVUR0.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VjKe9aX.png\" alt=\"VjKe9aX.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EP11Ds1.png\" alt=\"EP11Ds1.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/39CssYf.png\" alt=\"39CssYf.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8je3ZlE.png\" alt=\"8je3ZlE.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GMP0hSi.png\" alt=\"GMP0hSi.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QNhPT51.png\" alt=\"QNhPT51.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oDZYcZH.png\" alt=\"oDZYcZH.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mxDR9le.png\" alt=\"mxDR9le.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2cPBA3c.png\" alt=\"2cPBA3c.png\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Config options</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li>FckWeapons - All weapon slots (excluding magazine) have their filters expanded to include all mods from the same category (based on categories of mods already included in that weapon slot filter)</li>\n<li>FckMods - All mod slots have their filters expanded to include all mods from the same category (same as above)</li>\n<li>FckChambers - Use any bullet with any weapon</li>\n<li>FckCalibers: - Use any magazine with any weapon</li>\n<li>FckMagazines - Use any bullet with any magazine</li>\n<li>FckALL - All weapon and mod slots have their filters expanded by all attachment categories</li>\n<li>RemoveConflictingItems - Removes “Conflicting Items” restrictions from mods</li>\n<li>Experimental - Changing “unslot” method to instead of adding all mods from the same category, add category ID to the slot. Can fix infinite client loading, but can introduce other issues</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Notes</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li>If you have any issue with your installation of SPT, remove this mod first</li>\n<li>Removing this mod does not remove ANY cursed weapons already created</li>\n<li>Please do not use this mod with any <em>serious</em> Tarkov runs</li>\n<li>Bots WILL have cursed guns, unless APBS is used (but don’t tell Acid, I told you this! He will probably kill me for mentioning any of his mods here :V)</li>\n<li>My version of the mod is arguably better than the old one, because you can attach night vision goggles to your weapon – but they do not work, though… who could have guessed?</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Credits</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Original mod: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/354/all-in-weapon\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>“All In Weapon” by Lua</strong></a><br />\nRequested and play-tested by: <strong>ITube</strong></p></div></div></div>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.4", "content_length": 10283, "downloads": 272, "published_at": "2026-02-06T21:27:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2576/all-in-weapon-unslotted/1.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.4", "content_length": 10393, "downloads": 1614, "published_at": "2026-02-07T12:25:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2576/all-in-weapon-unslotted/1.0.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.1.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.4", "content_length": 13992, "downloads": 1571, "published_at": "2026-03-15T15:49:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2576/all-in-weapon-unslotted/1.1.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.1.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.4", "content_length": 14001, "downloads": 2276, "publish